(6058057, 891532, 102315, '<td valign="top">Great image. Love the color of the sky. Great imagination and creativity.</td>', 'Great image. Love the color of the sky. Great imagination and creativity.', '2010-06-16 01:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058058, 891306, 102315, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the tilt on this one</td>', 'I don''t like the tilt on this one', '2010-06-16 01:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058076, 891283, 114285, '<td valign="top">Excellent, love the reflection.</td>', 'Excellent, love the reflection.', '2010-06-16 01:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058097, 891646, 107410, '<td valign="top">OK...seriously...who do you know that OWNS a Lamborghini that let you set this up?! Regarding the pic, the Lambo is nice and sharp and I like that the red really pops in the tunnel, but my only gripe is that it doesn''t feel fast ENOUGH considering your subject. Other than that, nice entry. 9</td>', 'OK...seriously...who do you know that OWNS a Lamborghini that let you set this up?! Regarding the pic, the Lambo is nice and sharp and I like that the red really pops in the tunnel, but my only gripe is that it doesn''t feel fast ENOUGH considering your subject. Other than that, nice entry. 9', '2010-06-16 01:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058123, 891699, 54446, '<td valign="top">I gave this a "10", but there may be lens distortion or sizing problems, as evidenced by the elliptical star trails around Polaris.  Otherwise, this is great.</td>', 'I gave this a "10", but there may be lens distortion or sizing problems, as evidenced by the elliptical star trails around Polaris.  Otherwise, this is great.', '2010-06-16 01:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058127, 891305, 63503, '<td valign="top">Hope you have an outtake of this for ''point of color''. Great picture.</td>', 'Hope you have an outtake of this for ''point of color''. Great picture.', '2010-06-16 01:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058131, 891699, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2010-06-16 01:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058133, 891379, 67553, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrancy of your image, but I think that a longer exposure (to be more specific, more movement being evident in the grass and clouds) would have helped this fit the challenge better.</td>', 'I like the vibrancy of your image, but I think that a longer exposure (to be more specific, more movement being evident in the grass and clouds) would have helped this fit the challenge better.', '2010-06-16 01:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058134, 891524, 107410, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look very happy...</td>', 'She doesn''t look very happy...', '2010-06-16 01:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058138, 891747, 67553, '<td valign="top">While I do like the HDR tone of the image, there doesn''t seem to be a strong focal point in the image that is in sharp focus.  Additionally, I think that it''s rotated clockwise a bit.</td>', 'While I do like the HDR tone of the image, there doesn''t seem to be a strong focal point in the image that is in sharp focus.  Additionally, I think that it''s rotated clockwise a bit.', '2010-06-16 01:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058144, 891204, 107410, '<td valign="top">Very original idea! My only real gripe is that I would''ve liked to see the ladder turned more towards the camera to show at least some of the "artist''s" face. And maybe a different wardrobe choice...but that''s just being nitpicky. :-)</td>', 'Very original idea! My only real gripe is that I would''ve liked to see the ladder turned more towards the camera to show at least some of the "artist''s" face. And maybe a different wardrobe choice...but that''s just being nitpicky. :-)', '2010-06-16 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058153, 890843, 118194, '<td valign="top">yes, this is nice, and with good color and not terribly conventional composition :)</td>', 'yes, this is nice, and with good color and not terribly conventional composition :)', '2010-06-16 01:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058154, 891588, 107410, '<td valign="top">Nice, I love the abstract feel of this...I have a feeling that it will either gain you a top 10 or a brown. 10</td>', 'Nice, I love the abstract feel of this...I have a feeling that it will either gain you a top 10 or a brown. 10', '2010-06-16 01:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058161, 891615, 118194, '<td valign="top">nice, moody, i cannot convince myself there is no smoke in this picture</td>', 'nice, moody, i cannot convince myself there is no smoke in this picture', '2010-06-16 01:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058168, 891669, 118194, '<td valign="top">painting with light, ha?</td>', 'painting with light, ha?', '2010-06-16 01:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058173, 891353, 118194, '<td valign="top">looks like a shot of the screen saver :)</td>', 'looks like a shot of the screen saver :)', '2010-06-16 01:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058175, 891521, 107410, '<td valign="top">Whoa, pretty intense. Given the title and how she was executed, I generally like the processing, although it is noisy, but I don''t know how successful this will be with the "purists." 7</td>', 'Whoa, pretty intense. Given the title and how she was executed, I generally like the processing, although it is noisy, but I don''t know how successful this will be with the "purists." 7', '2010-06-16 01:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058178, 890547, 118194, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2010-06-16 01:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058182, 890469, 67553, '<td valign="top">Ahhh. . . . college.  I remember it fondly!  Then, it was a long time ago so I''m sure I''ve forgotten all of these nights!<br/> <br/>Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Ahhh. . . . college.  I remember it fondly!  Then, it was a long time ago so I''m sure I''ve forgotten all of these nights! Good take on the challenge.', '2010-06-16 01:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058184, 891736, 118194, '<td valign="top">spoooky!</td>', 'spoooky!', '2010-06-16 01:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058185, 891666, 54446, '<td valign="top">Outstanding motion blur and ghost effect of the moving trains.  Superb vanishing lines effect and perfect deep DOF.  Excellent photography!</td>', 'Outstanding motion blur and ghost effect of the moving trains.  Superb vanishing lines effect and perfect deep DOF.  Excellent photography!', '2010-06-16 01:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058191, 891239, 107410, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing and processing on the incoming wave. I wonder how many people who haven''t tried taking a picture of a breaking wave will give this the credit it deserves. Very well done. 10</td>', 'Perfect timing and processing on the incoming wave. I wonder how many people who haven''t tried taking a picture of a breaking wave will give this the credit it deserves. Very well done. 10', '2010-06-16 01:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
