(6058212, 891748, 107410, '<td valign="top">What story does this tell me about Exit 165? It doesn''t look like anyone exited there, so it just looks like another long exposure taken on an overpass; which is fine, but the title isn''t fitting. For framing, why didn''t you recompose more to the right? What do the vehicles coming towards you (read: the blown out blob) add to the photo? Why is the sign on the left cut off?</td>', 'What story does this tell me about Exit 165? It doesn''t look like anyone exited there, so it just looks like another long exposure taken on an overpass; which is fine, but the title isn''t fitting. For framing, why didn''t you recompose more to the right? What do the vehicles coming towards you (read: the blown out blob) add to the photo? Why is the sign on the left cut off?', '2010-06-16 01:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058213, 891239, 96751, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  Her stillness punctuates the swirling water.  Just lovely.</td>', 'FABULOUS!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  Her stillness punctuates the swirling water.  Just lovely.', '2010-06-16 01:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
