(6058226, 891558, 107410, '<td valign="top">I personally wish there was more foreground to give the waterfall somewhere to go. It''s like having someone running or looking off-frame, just doesn''t work for me. But the processing is pretty nice. There are a couple yellow patches in the waterfalls that could have been fixed since this is Advanced Editing. 7</td>', 'I personally wish there was more foreground to give the waterfall somewhere to go. It''s like having someone running or looking off-frame, just doesn''t work for me. But the processing is pretty nice. There are a couple yellow patches in the waterfalls that could have been fixed since this is Advanced Editing. 7', '2010-06-16 01:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058227, 890400, 67553, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Saw the face before I even read the title.  I like the B&amp;W treatment you gave this image.</td>', 'Yep.  Saw the face before I even read the title.  I like the B&W treatment you gave this image.', '2010-06-16 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
