(6058239, 891538, 67553, '<td valign="top">I''m not a normal border basher, but it''s the only thing I can find to complain about in this image.  This is well done and (I think) will do extremely well in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not a normal border basher, but it''s the only thing I can find to complain about in this image.  This is well done and (I think) will do extremely well in this challenge.', '2010-06-16 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
