(6058248, 890335, 67553, '<td valign="top">This feels like it''s tilted to the right just a bit.</td>', 'This feels like it''s tilted to the right just a bit.', '2010-06-16 02:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058252, 890804, 67553, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this image for the challenge, but it''s tilted to the right just enough to make it distracting.  Discounting that, I really like the mood conveyed by your shot.</td>', 'I really want to like this image for the challenge, but it''s tilted to the right just enough to make it distracting.  Discounting that, I really like the mood conveyed by your shot.', '2010-06-16 02:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058253, 891532, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oooohhh. Straight to faves.  Love that sky!!!!</td>', 'Oooohhh. Straight to faves.  Love that sky!!!!', '2010-06-16 02:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058264, 891699, 101707, '<td valign="top">Best image in this challenge. 10</td>', 'Best image in this challenge. 10', '2010-06-16 02:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058265, 890547, 101707, '<td valign="top">excellent. 10</td>', 'excellent. 10', '2010-06-16 02:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058266, 891673, 67553, '<td valign="top">While I understand and appreciate the difficulty of doing a long exposure during the day, I think that this image could have used some more post processing.  I think it needs to be rotated clockwise by about 5 degrees and to have the bottom portion cropped a bit closer to the falls.  <br/>You did a great job on the long exposure, and the falls themselves look great!</td>', 'While I understand and appreciate the difficulty of doing a long exposure during the day, I think that this image could have used some more post processing.  I think it needs to be rotated clockwise by about 5 degrees and to have the bottom portion cropped a bit closer to the falls.  You did a great job on the long exposure, and the falls themselves look great!', '2010-06-16 02:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058274, 891690, 67553, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrancy of this image, but am having a hard time understanding how it meets the long exposure challenge.</td>', 'I like the vibrancy of this image, but am having a hard time understanding how it meets the long exposure challenge.', '2010-06-16 02:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058336, 890996, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image !!</td>', 'Beautiful image !!', '2010-06-16 03:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
