(6058685, 890804, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great vantage point and overall balance to this photo. I really like how there are multiple light colors to give the scene a bit of extra dimension.</td>', 'Great vantage point and overall balance to this photo. I really like how there are multiple light colors to give the scene a bit of extra dimension.', '2010-06-16 09:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058705, 891824, 114225, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for here. I think it could have turned out better (in my mind) if you would have used a flash at the end to give the lady some solidness.</td>', 'I see what you were going for here. I think it could have turned out better (in my mind) if you would have used a flash at the end to give the lady some solidness.', '2010-06-16 09:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058712, 891472, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo has a very good sci-fi look (I like it!). The only thing that could really be improved (to me), is the distinct color banding in the sky (maybe that happened during jpeg conversion?).</td>', 'This photo has a very good sci-fi look (I like it!). The only thing that could really be improved (to me), is the distinct color banding in the sky (maybe that happened during jpeg conversion?).', '2010-06-16 09:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058721, 891146, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good attempt for the challenge. It''s too bad the sky is so blown out. That water looks like it''s moving fast enough, that you could have used a much faster shutter and still had the effect of a slow shutter. REally good use of composition though (S curve that exits the lower corner).</td>', 'Good attempt for the challenge. It''s too bad the sky is so blown out. That water looks like it''s moving fast enough, that you could have used a much faster shutter and still had the effect of a slow shutter. REally good use of composition though (S curve that exits the lower corner).', '2010-06-16 09:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058726, 891553, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good job achieving the dreamy water effect. To me, the scene doesn''t offer much other than that, so I kind of wonder what a closer view (telephoto) of the rock formation would be like.</td>', 'Good job achieving the dreamy water effect. To me, the scene doesn''t offer much other than that, so I kind of wonder what a closer view (telephoto) of the rock formation would be like.', '2010-06-16 09:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058730, 890630, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like a dangerous place to take a photo! It''s pretty cool how some of the taillights are wavy, is the road rough over there?</td>', 'Looks like a dangerous place to take a photo! It''s pretty cool how some of the taillights are wavy, is the road rough over there?', '2010-06-16 09:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058732, 891681, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this scene is calling for some sort of main subject (something in the water for the waves to splash against). Without that, there simply isn''t a lot to keep a viewer''s interest.</td>', 'To me, this scene is calling for some sort of main subject (something in the water for the waves to splash against). Without that, there simply isn''t a lot to keep a viewer''s interest.', '2010-06-16 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
