(6058740, 891010, 114225, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for here. To me, it feels like you could have use a somewhat faster shutter to keep some detail in the monument. As is, it feels a bit like a light saber!</td>', 'I see what you were going for here. To me, it feels like you could have use a somewhat faster shutter to keep some detail in the monument. As is, it feels a bit like a light saber!', '2010-06-16 09:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
