(6058834, 891753, 27608, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot Brad!  Looks like you and Jonathan scoped out the same locale!  Is this on the way to Niagra Falls, just outside of St. Catherines?  I know there''s a boat there, but am not sure if this is it.<br/> <br/>Very nice!  And I also like the slight curve at the front of the boat.  A shame I can''t vote on this one!</td>', 'Awesome shot Brad!  Looks like you and Jonathan scoped out the same locale!  Is this on the way to Niagra Falls, just outside of St. Catherines?  I know there''s a boat there, but am not sure if this is it. Very nice!  And I also like the slight curve at the front of the boat.  A shame I can''t vote on this one!', '2010-06-16 09:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058836, 891681, 111957, '<td valign="top">I wish there was some sort of subject to draw my eye.</td>', 'I wish there was some sort of subject to draw my eye.', '2010-06-16 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
