(6058889, 891527, 72929, '<td valign="top">nicely done. One of what, 3 astrophotos in this challenge? I didn''t see it in time to take a crack at it, not that the weather would''ve cooperated anyway.<br/> <br/>Would''ve gotten extra points if you could''ve incorporated a reflection of the stars in the water (assuming the water was still enough)</td>', 'nicely done. One of what, 3 astrophotos in this challenge? I didn''t see it in time to take a crack at it, not that the weather would''ve cooperated anyway. Would''ve gotten extra points if you could''ve incorporated a reflection of the stars in the water (assuming the water was still enough)', '2010-06-16 10:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058890, 890547, 72929, '<td valign="top">kewl. looks like a low-level fog. stood out among the thumbnails.</td>', 'kewl. looks like a low-level fog. stood out among the thumbnails.', '2010-06-16 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058891, 891389, 28564, '<td valign="top">mmhhh... i see a double exposure, not a long exposure... i like the shot, but i do not think that is in the right challenge... so i give you a 5.</td>', 'mmhhh... i see a double exposure, not a long exposure... i like the shot, but i do not think that is in the right challenge... so i give you a 5.', '2010-06-16 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6058892, 891651, 72929, '<td valign="top">nicely done, incorporating wedding photography in a long exposure. This has a romantic feel to it. I personally would''ve removed the red cast, but that''s just a matter of taste, not any real reason to.</td>', 'nicely done, incorporating wedding photography in a long exposure. This has a romantic feel to it. I personally would''ve removed the red cast, but that''s just a matter of taste, not any real reason to.', '2010-06-16 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
