(6058914, 890400, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cool photo and interesting processing. It''s difficult for me to see, though, how this demonstrates use of a long exposure.</td>', 'Cool photo and interesting processing. It''s difficult for me to see, though, how this demonstrates use of a long exposure.', '2010-06-16 10:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
