(6059541, 891531, 39679, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The exposure was short enough to not completely blur the entire carousel.  However, the crane, in the background, is really distracting.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The exposure was short enough to not completely blur the entire carousel.  However, the crane, in the background, is really distracting.', '2010-06-16 15:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
