(6061001, 891673, 17507, '<td valign="top">I love waterfalls, and this one looks like it has some interesting features. But there are some real compositional problems here--namely the titled horizon and the distracting foreground elements. A closer crop would have helped. Also, some sharpening and selective levels adjustments would have helped bring out the definition in the water. (5)</td>', 'I love waterfalls, and this one looks like it has some interesting features. But there are some real compositional problems here--namely the titled horizon and the distracting foreground elements. A closer crop would have helped. Also, some sharpening and selective levels adjustments would have helped bring out the definition in the water. (5)', '2010-06-17 15:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061004, 891813, 17507, '<td valign="top">Given the overall tranquil feel of this image, I wonder if it would have been stronger if it had been rotated to keep the foreground rocks in a horizontal line. (6)</td>', 'Given the overall tranquil feel of this image, I wonder if it would have been stronger if it had been rotated to keep the foreground rocks in a horizontal line. (6)', '2010-06-17 15:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061005, 891747, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cool falls, generally strong composition. Too much tone-mapping and too little sharpening for my taste. (6)</td>', 'Cool falls, generally strong composition. Too much tone-mapping and too little sharpening for my taste. (6)', '2010-06-17 15:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061007, 890843, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, nice pose, strong colors. But I don''t see how a long exposure really helps here; I''d have preferred to see this with the motion frozen rather than blurred, or perhaps it''s simply not blurred enough. The overall effect is one of softening--there should be something sharper here. Motion blur doesn''t have to mean that nothing is well focused. (6)</td>', 'Cool shot, nice pose, strong colors. But I don''t see how a long exposure really helps here; I''d have preferred to see this with the motion frozen rather than blurred, or perhaps it''s simply not blurred enough. The overall effect is one of softening--there should be something sharper here. Motion blur doesn''t have to mean that nothing is well focused. (6)', '2010-06-17 15:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061008, 890469, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of the nightmare of crunch time. Stronger light from the side of the foreground face would have increased impact.</td>', 'Nice depiction of the nightmare of crunch time. Stronger light from the side of the foreground face would have increased impact.', '2010-06-17 15:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061011, 890630, 17507, '<td valign="top">The title does not enhance the photograph. Indicating typicality in the title only makes the photo itself seem more typical unless it''s of something very unusual, in which case the irony is appropriate. (5)</td>', 'The title does not enhance the photograph. Indicating typicality in the title only makes the photo itself seem more typical unless it''s of something very unusual, in which case the irony is appropriate. (5)', '2010-06-17 15:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061016, 891578, 17507, '<td valign="top">Flowing water is a good choice for this challenge. I don''t think the out-of-focus quintuplicated background figures enhance the photo. (6)</td>', 'Flowing water is a good choice for this challenge. I don''t think the out-of-focus quintuplicated background figures enhance the photo. (6)', '2010-06-17 15:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061019, 891236, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure, strong composition--rather too soft and saturated for my tastes, though.  (7)</td>', 'Nice long exposure, strong composition--rather too soft and saturated for my tastes, though.  (7)', '2010-06-17 15:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6061021, 890816, 17507, '<td valign="top">Title seems at odds with the photo--waves breaking on a rocky coast, brooding clouds, and a dark color palette do not indicate serenity. (6)</td>', 'Title seems at odds with the photo--waves breaking on a rocky coast, brooding clouds, and a dark color palette do not indicate serenity. (6)', '2010-06-17 15:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
