(6061027, 891322, 117559, '<td valign="top">7, I think maybe it is a little bit too saturated.  The house windows are a really bright unatural green.  However I do love how you captured the river.</td>', '7, I think maybe it is a little bit too saturated.  The house windows are a really bright unatural green.  However I do love how you captured the river.', '2010-06-17 15:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
