(6067042, 891699, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave this a "10", but there may be lens distortion or sizing problems, as evidenced by the elliptical star trails around Polaris.  Otherwise, this is great. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t do lens correction to compensate the distortion because I am not sure if it''s legal in advanced editing. The rules said distortion tools are not allowed but didn''t say lens correction purpose is allowed. Any SC can clarify this? thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: I gave this a "10", but there may be lens distortion or sizing problems, as evidenced by the elliptical star trails around Polaris.  Otherwise, this is great.   I didn''t do lens correction to compensate the distortion because I am not sure if it''s legal in advanced editing. The rules said distortion tools are not allowed but didn''t say lens correction purpose is allowed. Any SC can clarify this? thanks.', '2010-06-23 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
