(6067461, 891846, 63218, '<td valign="top">Hi Prash. I gave this a 6. The folded-up sitting figure is interesting, the standing figure conveyed action of some kind but what? I still don''t much like the bit of ceiling at the top, or the baseboard/carpet, it places this in a specific location &amp; if you''re going to do that you may as well include furniture &amp; clothes. I couldn''t make up my mind about the window light pattern on the wall, but in the end I decided I liked it &amp; that''s why I gave it a 6.</td>', 'Hi Prash. I gave this a 6. The folded-up sitting figure is interesting, the standing figure conveyed action of some kind but what? I still don''t much like the bit of ceiling at the top, or the baseboard/carpet, it places this in a specific location & if you''re going to do that you may as well include furniture & clothes. I couldn''t make up my mind about the window light pattern on the wall, but in the end I decided I liked it & that''s why I gave it a 6.', '2010-06-23 10:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
