(6073438, 890551, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a clever idea and the streak of light was well executed.  I gave this a 6 I think because I felt that you didn''t really need the matchbox in the shot and I''d like to have seen the jar with burnt matches moved more into the frame.  Still tho, your commenters loved it - so what do I know?  :D</td>', 'I thought this was a clever idea and the streak of light was well executed.  I gave this a 6 I think because I felt that you didn''t really need the matchbox in the shot and I''d like to have seen the jar with burnt matches moved more into the frame.  Still tho, your commenters loved it - so what do I know?  :D', '2010-06-29 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
